          </div>
          <p>
            When designing user interfaces, applying a <strong>complementary color wheel</strong> ensures that buttons, callouts, and key interaction states pop effortlessly against neutral backdrops. Remember to balance complementary pairs using the <strong>60-30-10 rule</strong>: 60% neutral background, 30% brand secondary, and 10% complementary accent.
